# Leave empty. The frontend calls relative /api/* URLs:
#  - local dev:   Vite's dev server proxies /api/* to the backend (vite.config.ts)
#  - production:  the API is served from the same domain (single Vercel project,
#                 or the Express server serving frontend/dist)
# Only set this if you deliberately host the API on a different domain, e.g.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://my-api.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
